  "analysis_md": "解 当$0\\le x\\le1$时，$y=1-(1-x)=x$，则$dy=dx$；\n当$1\\le x\\le2$时，$y=1-(x-1)=2-x$，则$dy=-dx$；\n$$\\int_C(x^2+y^2)dx+(x^2-y^2)dy=\\int_0^1 2x^2dx+\\int_1^2[x^2+(2-x)^2-x^2+(2-x)^2]dx=\\frac{4}{3}$$",
  "search_text": "计算 $\\int_C(x^2+y^2)dx+(x^2-y^2)dy$，$C:y=1-|1-x|,0\\le x\\le2$。 $4$ $\\frac1{35}$ $\\frac43$ $2$ 解 当$0\\le x\\le1$时，$y=1-(1-x)=x$，则$dy=dx$；\n当$1\\le x\\le2$时，$y=1-(x-1)=2-x$，则$dy=-dx$；\n$$\\int_C(x^2+y^2)dx+(x^2-y^2)dy=\\int_0^1 2x^2dx+\\int_1^2[x^2+(2-x)^2-x^2+(2-x)^2]dx=\\frac{4}{3}$$",
